{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L148"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Connectivity","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with roots in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order and successors in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order. That is a reverse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"topological order of the condensation: every edge between components goes from a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component to an earlier one, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reversed()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the components with every edge going"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forward. Each component lists its vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":", so on a graph whose vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions are insertion order ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On any graph, one pass over ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lists them in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, O(V):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(V + E).","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()"},"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","title":"GraphProtocols","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/stronglyConnectedComponents()":{"abstract":[{"text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Tarjan’s algorithm.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/Components":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A partition of a graph’s vertices into components, in a documented order: a collection of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components, each a slice of vertices in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, with an O(1) ","type":"text"},{"code":"component(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/components","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Components","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Components","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity":{"role":"collection","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity","title":"Connectivity","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","title":"DirectedGraph","type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}